  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercise_type\": \"CEFR English Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"The concept of sustainability has become increasingly important in recent years. Many people believe that it is the key to a better future for our planet. However, others argue that it is an unachievable goal due to the high costs involved.\n\nA sustainable lifestyle requires making conscious choices about how we live and consume resources. This can include using public transport, reducing energy consumption, and buying locally sourced products. Some people believe that these changes are too difficult to implement and that they will have a negative impact on the economy.\n\nDespite these concerns, many countries are making significant strides in adopting sustainable practices. For example, some cities are investing heavily in renewable energy sources such as solar and wind power. Others are implementing green infrastructure projects, such as parks and bike lanes, to reduce carbon emissions.\n\nWhile there is still much work to be done, the benefits of sustainability far outweigh the costs. By making small changes to our daily lives, we can significantly reduce our impact on the environment and create a more sustainable future for generations to come.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main idea of the article?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The benefits of sustainability outweigh the costs.\", \"Sustainability is an unachievable goal due to high costs.\", \"Making conscious choices about how we live is essential for a sustainable lifestyle.\", \"Renewable energy sources are the only solution to environmental problems.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The benefits of sustainability outweigh the costs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"According to the article, what is one way to reduce carbon emissions?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Using private cars instead of public transport.\", \"Buying locally sourced products.\", \"Implementing green infrastructure projects such as parks and bike lanes.\", \"Reducing energy consumption by using more electricity.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"Implementing green infrastructure projects such as parks and bike lanes.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's attitude towards sustainability?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The author believes that sustainability is an unachievable goal.\", \"The author thinks that making small changes to our daily lives will have a negative impact on the economy.\", \"The author argues that the benefits of sustainability far outweigh the costs.\", \"The author suggests that renewable energy sources are not effective.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"The author argues that the benefits of sustainability far outweigh the costs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What is one example given in the article of a country making significant strides in adopting sustainable practices?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Investing heavily in renewable energy sources such as solar and wind power.\", \"Implementing green infrastructure projects such as parks and bike lanes.\", \"Reducing carbon emissions by using private cars instead of public transport.\", \"Buying locally sourced products.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"Investing heavily in renewable energy sources such as solar and wind power.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's purpose in writing this article?\",\n      \"options\": [\"To convince readers that sustainability is an unachievable goal.\", \"To inform readers about the benefits of making conscious choices about how we live.\", \"To persuade readers to adopt a sustainable lifestyle by highlighting its benefits.\", \"To discuss the negative impact of sustainability on the economy.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"To inform readers about the benefits of making conscious choices about how we live.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
